MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The DVI-to-HDMI cable connects naturally to my previous DVI cable purchase because it could solve a related display connection problem, if I needed those connectors.",
    "The USB WiFi adapter fits my history of practical networking purchases, though I would need a replacement reason and confirmed compatibility before choosing it."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The hard drive, SSD bracket, thermal pad and RAM each require a specific upgrade or repair project that my purchases do not establish.",
    "Buying networking adapters does not mean I want to build WiFi electronics; the development board serves a different purpose. The label tape, protection plan and mouse also lack a clear connection to a current need."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My purchases seem to have been treated as broad interest in computer accessories, even though each addressed a particular connection or equipment need.",
    "Shared words such as USB and WiFi seem to carry too much weight when the products do very different jobs."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Connector types, operating-system support and device compatibility determine whether an otherwise relevant accessory would actually help me.",
    "My interactions are infrequent and spread over years. A past purchase does not establish an ongoing upgrade project or a present need for another similar item."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognize my practical connectivity needs but infer too much ongoing interest in unrelated computer upgrades and accessories."
}
